{"articleNo":"202340","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=202340&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2019 JAPANESE GOVERNMENT (MONBUKAGAKUSHO (MEXT)) SCHOLARSHIP","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.12.31","hit":"6475","attachments":[{"name":"MEXT Scholarship 2019.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=202340&attachNo=79584"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\" align=\"center\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;News Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">2019 JAPANESE GOVERNMENT (MONBUKAGAKUSHO (MEXT)) SCHOLARSHIP<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\" align=\"center\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;News Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">(RESEARCH STUDENT)</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>This scholarship is mainly for the person who studies to <u style=\"text-underline: double\">seek for a degree at Kanazawa University</u>.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1 Qualifications<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">1) Nationality:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>An applicant must have the nationality of a country which has diplomatic relations with the Japanese government and should come to Japan directly from abroad. Applicants who have Japanese nationality at the time of application are not eligible in principal. However, applicants of dual nationality who reside outside Japan are eligible only if they will expatriate from Japan by the time of arrival in Japan. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">2) Age: An applicant must be born on or after </span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">April 2, 1984</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">3) Academic Background:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>An applicants must satisfy or will satisfy qualification requirements for admission to a Japanese graduate school. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: red\">Please note that applicant’s academic record for last two years will be calculated by the method which is designated by Monbukagakusho. Also, applicants are required to satisfy English or Japanese skills which is mentioned in the 5) Language lines. If it does not meet the requirements, the applicant will be disqualified for application.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">4) Study Area:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>The study area must be in the same field as the applicant has studied or is now studying, or in a related one.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">5) Language:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>An applicant must have enough Japanese or English skills to conduct academic research and education. An applicant is required to satisfy any of the following conditions.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span>[Japanese]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.55pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">①<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who has passed <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold\">Japanese Language Proficiency Test (JLPT)</span> N1/N2 level.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.55pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">②<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who completed the curriculum which meets the qualification to enter Japanese master’s/doctoral course of graduate school in an institution where main instruction was in Japanese.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.55pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">③<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who can be concluded that he/she has Japanese ability equivalent to or higher than </span><span lang=\"JA\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;MS Mincho&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;MS Mincho&quot;\">①</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">[English]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.75pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">①<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who has CEFR B2 or equivalent/higher level of English ability.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.75pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">②<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who completed the curriculum which meets the qualification to enter Japanese master’s/doctoral course of graduate school in an institution where main instruction was in English.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.75pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\">③<span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">An applicant who can be concluded that he/she has English ability equal to or more higher than </span><span lang=\"JA\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;MS Mincho&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;MS Mincho&quot;\">①</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 34.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 16.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">*If you would like to convert your English scores into CEFR, please refer to the website below.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 16.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.mext.go.jp/b_menu/houdou/30/03/__icsFiles/afieldfile/2018/03/26/1402610.pdf\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">http://www.mext.go.jp/b_menu/houdou/30/03/__icsFiles/afieldfile/2018/03/26/1402610.pdf</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 16.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">​</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 16.75pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">​</span></p><div style=\"mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 7.1pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: margin; mso-element-left: right; mso-element-top: 2.7pt; mso-height-rule: exactly\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"right\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: #f0f0f0; BORDER-BOTTOM: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 7.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-RIGHT: 7.1pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 44pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; mso-char-indent-count: -4.0; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 7.1pt; mso-element-wrap: around; ms